  "description": "I propose to install one dedicated domestic EV chargepoint (Andersen A3, tethered Type 2, 7 kW) fixed to the external front wall at Location B: the left side of the bay window, wholly within my property boundary.\n\nThe charging cable will be routed over the front garden wall and secured using UV‑ and weather‑resistant cable clips. The cable will then be threaded directly into the Council‑approved footway channel (ref 8211730371) at the agreed location.\n\n**Fixings and protection:**  \nAll external fixings will be weatherproof stainless steel, sealed with exterior‑grade silicone. Cable contact points will be protected to prevent wear.\n\n**Trip‑hazard mitigation:**\nThe cable will be kept tight to the wall and will enter the pavement gully before reaching the vehicle. It will not cross the public footway outside the gully.",
